values ('edf-r-d-prisme-sampling-algorithms-for-uncertainty-propagation-in-limited-data-regimes-202', 'EDF (R&D, PRISME)', 'Sampling algorithms for uncertainty propagation in limited data regimes', 'Sampling algorithms for uncertainty propagation in limited data regimes', 'company', 'Chatou', 'France', 'unknown', 'Between €1230 and €1557 per month (gross)', null, 'unknown', null, 'open', 'Final-year engineering or Master''s student; applied maths, probability and statistics, Python', 'yes', '2026-186645', 'https://www.edf.fr/edf-recrute/offre/detail/2026-186645', 'portal', null, null, 'official_posting', 'https://www.edf.fr/edf-recrute/offre/detail/2026-186645', 'Study and compare sampling methods (deterministic sampling, quasi-Monte Carlo, Latin hypercubes, Bayesian quadrature) for propagating uncertainty through costly CFD simulators when only a few dozen runs are available. Includes a Python benchmark on analytic functions and a theoretical look at the guarantees given by Gaussian-process-based Bayesian quadrature.', 'PRISME department, PSPP (probability and statistics for physical phenomena) team.', array['theory', 'physics-sim', 'trustworthy-ai']::text[], 1230, 1557, null, null, '2026-11-10', null, '2026-11-11', '2026-11-11')
